     "group": "Laboratory monitoring in recovery and relapse",
     "grade": "1C",
     "text": "ADAMTS13 activity assay differences indicate that for monitoring, and identification of remission and relapse, the same analytical method should be used in any single patient to retain sensitivity for clinically significant changes.",
